>I hit a polymorph trap. It said 'You feel like a new man. What is your name?'
>I said ZidII. (Was Zid.) Later I saved my game. When I restarted nethack
>it started a new game. I was not amused. My NETHACKOPTIONS sets my name too
>"Zid". I reset it to "ZidII" and got my saved game back.
>I liked the old behavior of 2.x. Anyone else have an option.

You don't have to change your NETHACKOPTIONS.

All you had to do was "nethack -uZidII".

The "old behavior" was a bug--not only could you restore it using the old name,
but then your name _was_ the old name, and the new name completely went away.
